:''For the enemies, see [[Crazed Bird Cat (Enemy)]] or [[Manic Flying Cat (Enemy)]].''
'''Crazed Bird Cat''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by completing the event stage [[Flappy Cat (Insane)|The Crazed Bird]] appearing on the '''18th''' of every month. It was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.3 Update|Version 2.2.3]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]] increases damage and range at the cost of making their time between attacks longer. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], this unit can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] after beating Cosmic Club in Ch. 3 Interstellar Invasion. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], the stage of where you can obtain this unit appears every '''Wednesday'''.

